Group 1 (c4 = 1):
  • Two rows with a date that appears as '2020-01-02' (the qualifying date) but stored slightly differently.
  • One row with the minimum date '2020-01-01'.
Group 2 (c4 = 2):
  • One row only so that no qualifying row exists.
*/

