In Q1 the join will count 2 for c4=1, while Q2’s use of DENSE_RANK will assign rank 1 to '2020-01-01' and rank 2 to '2020-01-02' (only one copy), so that group contributes only 1. 
Group 2 is added as a control where only one row meets the consecutive condition. 
